DFE2:                                                                                 ; PTRGET -- GENERAL VARIABLE SCAN
DFE2:                          
DFE2:                                                                                 ; SCANS VARIABLE NAME AT TXTPTR, AND SEARCHES THE
DFE2:                                                                                 ; VARTAB AND ARYTAB FOR THE NAME.
