DFE2:                                                                                 ; RETURN WITH ADDRESS IN VARPNT AND Y,A
DFE2:                          
DFE2:                                                                                 ; ACTUAL ACTIVITY CONTROLLED SOMEWHAT BY TWO FLAGS:
DFE2:                                                                                 ; DIMFLG -- NONZERO IF CALLED FROM "DIM"

