EC22:                                                                                 ; "INT" FUNCTION
EC22:                          
EC22:                                                                                 ; USES QINT TO CONVERT (FAC) TO INTEGER FORM,
EC22:                                                                                 ; AND THEN REFLOATS THE INTEGER.
